<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-28T08:12:30.398Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 08:12:30 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;A school explosion in Afghanistan's Kunar province killed and injured several students, adding to recent attacks on civilians in the region. Pakistani border forces shot dead an intruder in Punjab and killed six terrorists in Kech, Balochistan, while Pakistani troops downed a Taliban drone that entered its airspace. Saudi and Turkish officials arrived in Pakistan for trilateral defence talks linked to the Saudi-Houthi escalation in Yemen, and the UK Army Chief visited the Pakistan-Afghanistan border amid heightened tensions. The conflict produced 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Firstpost&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economic Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTE4yR1F2Szk1Q1BucHNIQlhCNXJlYjlGZm1NSXVOYnNlZ3RZUy16eDFVZTdUWmRSY0lIZ2p5TmlOZWVZTmtuUWNqSWFJS1BMLUQzTXJJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;شبكة تواصل الإخبارية&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxOQ2FueGhJWk84bW5NUTU2VU5jWnkyXzFlNm9Lcm5vcklYME9rRk5QbndkSWdBNTdRRkRUNU8zY1phM2Q2SWU2VFVaUmFMSUxsZkJ3Yk9HRVp2Tnk0QmxiNklZbl9CZGpVSWtRUzFoaWJTcEJQblhiZjdmdGJaQ25GTC1zSnBjZWdMTXYtdWdpTjJ6NWZYaHJ6Ul90c3FLOU8zRTdtZERZWVpwSmNOUlZWM3dUQy1xT3l4TzZrTmVWOEhFcmtyWGNqbg?oc=5&quot;&gt;www.yourvalley.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;WINK News - Southwest Florida&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxQOGFnNGlCZVYtc2pHTXR5Z041QlUzM0VaUk5qdTVrYTlIejdzSkt3UlJoVG5fUDJRbEplb1NtOFlrV0NsZ1JiLTZhUUZzVVdwc3N